{'symbol': 'CTVA', 'date': '2023-03-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'CORTEVA AGRISCIENCE ANNOUNCES COMMERCIAL LAUNCH OF VORCEED™ ENLIST® CORN PRODUCTS', 'text': 'THE NEXT GENERATION OF CORN ROOTWORM TRAIT TECHNOLOGY WILL LAUNCH THROUGH EXCLUSIVE CORTEVA HORIZON NETWORK PROGRAM INDIANAPOLIS , MARCH 7, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CORTEVA AGRISCIENCE TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS FOR THE COMMERCIAL LAUNCH OF VORCEED™ ENLIST® CORN PRODUCTS. U.S. FARMERS WILL ACCESS VORCEED ENLIST CORN TECHNOLOGY ACROSS PIONEER® SEEDS, DAIRYLAND SEED® AND BREVANT® SEEDS THROUGH THE EXCLUSIVE CORTEVA HORIZON NETWORK IN AREAS OF HIGH CORN ROOTWORM (CRW) PRESSURE IN THE CORN BELT.'}